00:51:55.134 --> 00:51:58.212
Yeah, yeah, it's very sincere.

00:51:58.212 --> 00:51:59.443
There's a sincere,

00:51:59.443 --> 00:52:00.493
it's there, it's not,

00:52:02.310 --> 00:52:04.500
you can really read into your experience

00:52:04.500 --> 00:52:08.252
because it's kind of on
the page in a lot of ways,

