this is gonna do that too.

00:53:38.670 --> 00:53:41.070
And it's gonna do it in a way that,

00:53:41.070 --> 00:53:42.870
it's gonna do it in a different way.

00:53:43.860 --> 00:53:46.170
Music is so powerful.

00:53:46.170 --> 00:53:50.973
It's powerful in a totally
different way than podcasts.

00:53:53.040 --> 00:53:54.513
I keep saying exciting,

00:53:55.768 --> 00:53:58.320
but that's just what I keep
going back to is that like,

00:53:58.320 --> 00:54:00.472
I'm just celebrating the fact

00:54:00.472 --> 00:54:01.590
