00:54:07.530 --> 00:54:08.433
Because when you,

00:54:11.172 --> 00:54:14.670
this song at least is something
that you've already said

00:54:14.670 --> 00:54:16.173
a number of times I felt like.

00:54:17.192 --> 00:54:18.873
So where is the risk?

00:54:20.760 --> 00:54:22.083
Where is the fear?

00:54:23.460 --> 00:54:25.473
Well, I mean, I think there's,

00:54:27.030 --> 00:54:28.803
it doesn't stay this tame.

00:54:30.224 --> 00:54:31.590
Hmm, you know?

00:54:31.590 --> 00:54:33.930
There are some, what you
might call angry songs

00:54:33.930 --> 00:54:36.870
where I'm just letting my
emotions and the way I feel about.

