He did.

00:54:49.770 --> 00:54:50.603
I'm shameless.

00:54:50.603 --> 00:54:52.920
Yeah, and I don't want any
Chris Gaines comparisons.

00:54:52.920 --> 00:54:54.390
Appreciate not doing anything.

00:54:54.390 --> 00:54:55.290
I didn't say it.

00:54:56.130 --> 00:54:58.470
So I think that there's a
little bit of that, but I think

00:54:58.470 --> 00:54:59.580
Chris Gains.

00:54:59.580 --> 00:55:00.980
People know where I stand.

00:55:05.880 --> 00:55:08.310
Every once in a while I
toss a little bomb out

00:55:08.310 --> 00:55:09.543
