00:55:10.800 --> 00:55:13.410
or whatever the analogy,
that's not a good one.

00:55:13.410 --> 00:55:14.340
I stir things up.

00:55:14.340 --> 00:55:16.140
I kick the hornets nest a little bit

00:55:16.140 --> 00:55:18.780
