00:55:21.780 --> 00:55:23.220
Let me ask you this question.

00:55:23.220 --> 00:55:24.870
It's gonna stir that up a little bit.

00:55:24.870 --> 00:55:25.703
Do you,

00:55:26.670 --> 00:55:30.720
have you felt like it was
a bigger risk creatively

00:55:30.720 --> 00:55:32.613
