00:55:35.250 --> 00:55:39.093
by doing this project than what,

00:55:39.930 --> 00:55:42.240
or is it what you're saying in the lyrics?

00:55:42.240 --> 00:55:44.490
Is it the message that
you're getting across?

00:55:45.657 --> 00:55:47.280
Because there's a creative risk involved

00:55:47.280 --> 00:55:51.450
in saying, hey, I'm one
half of Rhett and Link.

00:55:51.450 --> 00:55:53.160
This is what you know me for.

00:55:53.160 --> 00:55:54.363
I'm a comedian,

00:55:58.110 --> 00:56:00.060
if it were me, I would have to get over

00:56:01.491 --> 00:56:04.620
this hurdle of like, embarrassment.

00:56:04.620 --> 00:56:06.003
That would be like,

00:56:07.444 --> 00:56:08.310
is there risk there?

00:56:08.310 --> 00:56:09.330
Is there fear there?

00:56:09.330 --> 00:56:10.680
Has that been part of this.

00:56:13.470 --> 00:56:15.033
For better or for worse?

00:56:17.190 --> 00:56:18.870
I just always approach things,

00:56:18.870 --> 00:56:21.870
just believing that I'm gonna
find some way to pull 'em off.

00:56:23.066 --> 00:56:23.899
And it's probably.

00:56:23.899 --> 00:56:24.732
Okay.

00:56:24.732 --> 00:56:28.170
It's probably a misguided
self-confidence that,

00:56:28.170 --> 00:56:30.210
yes, I can do this and I can make an album

00:56:30.210 --> 00:56:31.350
that I would actually,

00:56:31.350 --> 00:56:34.470
if I were not myself enjoy and like.

00:56:34.470 --> 00:56:37.620
Well, I'm not embarrassed for
you now that I've heard it,

00:56:37.620 --> 00:56:38.453
I'll say that.

00:56:39.549 --> 00:56:40.897
But I mean to, I guess.

00:56:40.897 --> 00:56:41.820
But yeah, that moment when you're like,

00:56:41.820 --> 00:56:45.000
for the first time here and on GMM,

00:56:45.000 --> 00:56:48.093
when you're saying I've
released a country music,

00:56:49.470 --> 00:56:51.690
there's a little album,

00:56:51.690 --> 00:56:53.796
is there a sheepishness there?

00:56:53.796 --> 00:56:55.157
Is there like?

00:56:55.157 --> 00:56:57.066
I think from a creative standpoint,

00:56:57.066 --> 00:56:59.680
when one of the things
you're most well known for

00:57:00.614 --> 00:57:02.430
is like being on your knees
and having your best friend pee

00:57:02.430 --> 00:57:05.084
